# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the values. Never commit .env or .env.local.
#
# API base URL for the Fish API (API.Framework, no /v1 version segment).
# The UI reads this through the environment variable name NEXT_PUBLIC_SYSTEM_API_ROOT only
# (see src/config/environment.ts). Restart `npm run dev` after changing it.
#
# Example (local Development API; the Test launch profile is typically https://localhost:7188/):
NEXT_PUBLIC_SYSTEM_API_ROOT=https://localhost:7088/
